From a7ef01f948ef16e4cc9950f6e6a0104ab102b1a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:33:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] trace: add env-gated inference trace emitter

Adds OLLAMA_TRACE_URL, OLLAMA_TRACE_DETAIL, OLLAMA_TRACE_STEP and
OLLAMA_TRACE_STEP_TIMEOUT and a trace package that streams v1 visualizer
events over a WebSocket. When the URL is unset every call is a no-op on a
nil *RequestTracer. A single writer goroutine owns the socket, reconnects
with backoff and never blocks callers: droppable events are discarded when
the queue is full, critical events spill into a bounded overflow list. A
reader goroutine handles step-mode acks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
